msgstr "Máximu númberu de decimales que s'amuesen."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Precision), group (Precision)
#: kcalc.kcfg:70
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\tKCalc can compute with many more digits than the number that\n"
"\tfits on the display. This setting gives the maximum number of\n"
"\tdigits displayed, before KCalc starts using scientific notation,\n"
"\ti.e. notation of the type 2.34e12.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\tKCalc pue calcular munchos más decimales que'l númberu que\n"
"\tcueye nel ventanu. Esta configuración da'l máximu númberu de\n"
"\tdecimales que s'amuesen, antes de que KCalc entame a usar\n"
"\tnotación científica, ex. notación del tipo 2.34e12.\n"
"      "

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FixedPrecision), group (Precision)
#: kcalc.kcfg:76
#, kde-format
msgid "Number of fixed decimal digits."
msgstr "Númberu de cifres decimales fixes."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Fixed), group (Precision)
#: kcalc.kcfg:80
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to use fixed decimal places."
msgstr "Si usar sitios decimales fixos."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Beep), group (General)
#: kcalc.kcfg:86
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to beep on error."
msgstr "Pitar si hai un error."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CaptionResult), group (General)
#: kcalc.kcfg:90
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to show the result in the window title."
msgstr "Si amosar el resultáu nel títulu de la ventana."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (GroupDigits), group (General)
#: kcalc.kcfg:94
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to group digits."
msgstr "Si agrupar díxitos."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (TwosComplement), group (General)
#: kcalc.kcfg:98
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to use Two's Complement for non-decimal numbers."
msgstr "Usu de complementu a dos pa númberos non decimales."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (TwosComplement), group (General)
#: kcalc.kcfg:103
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Select to use Two's Complement notation for Binary, Octal\n"
"        and Hexidecimal numbers. This is a common notation to represent\n"
"        negative numbers in computers.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Esbilla l'usu de la notación complementu a dos pa númberos\n"
"        binarios, octales y hexadecimales. Trátase d'una notación típica pa\n"
"        representar númberos negativos en sistemes informáticos.\n"
"      "

